                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "religion",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "In seventeenth-century England, religious <w>nonconformity</w> could lead to heavy fines and imprisonment."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "His family had a proud history of <w>nonconformity</w> and worshipped at an independent chapel."
